        "fix: [taal] in 'hy werk is 'n uitset': 'Al die energie ... is 'n uitset' reads oddly (all the energy as one output), and the two verbs meet without a comma.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Daardie stoot op die pedale is die fiets se inset.': The lesson defines inset as energy, but this sentence calls a push (stoot) the inset; a push is closer to a force (krag), the confusion the protected energie entry warns about. Not changed, because fixing it means choosing content; for the writer or a person to judge.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'die wiele draai onder hom': Hom could mean the bicycle or the rider; probably the rider. Left unchanged because choosing would guess the intent."
